  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "refactor(core): decouple managers and middleware into LuciferCore.Platforms\n\n      BREAKING CHANGE: Decouple higher-level runtime services and middlewares to streamline LuciferCore as a pure zero-allocation kernel.\n\n      - Extracted managers to LuciferCore.Platforms:\n      * LogManager\n      * SimulationManager\n      - Extracted middlewares to LuciferCore.Platforms:\n      * FirewallMiddleware\n      * RateLimitMiddleware\n      * SessionMiddleware\n      - Stripped application-level dependencies and in-memory business logic from Core.\n      - Reduced overall assembly footprint, memory surface, and compilation overhead.\n      - Bumped version to 6.1.0 in preparation for the standalone LuciferCore.Platforms package.",
